1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
This Reel did three point one times the account’s average. Luck? No. Four decisions you can copy.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Decision one: it opened on the result. The finished thing, first frame. Curiosity does the rest — how did we get here?

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Two: it changed frames every three seconds, but the story never changed lanes. Motion without confusion.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Three: the save moment was built in — a checklist card right at peak attention. And four: the caption’s first line repeated the promise instead of saying “new post!!”

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:36,000
None of this is magic. It’s boring, repeatable structure — which is the best news possible, because you can do boring on purpose. Method in bio.

